# Validation

- Use `ValidationPipe` (`class-validator`) globally or per-controller — no manual try/catch validation
- DTO validates **shape** only (format/type/required). Business rules belong in service
- Do not reuse the same DTO for unrelated use cases; split create/update/query DTOs
- Do not expose internal/sensitive fields; use `class-transformer` (`@Exclude`, `@Transform`) or explicit mappers

